{'symbol': 'BG', 'date': '2022-02-24 08:30:00', 'title': 'BUNGE LIMITED DECLARES DIVIDENDS ON COMMON AND PREFERENCE SHARES', 'text': 'ST. LOUIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BUNGE LIMITED (NYSE: BG) ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED ON FEBRUARY 23, 2022 A COMMON QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.525 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JUNE 2, 2022 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD ON MAY 19, 2022. THE COMPANY ALSO DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $1.21875 PER SHARE ON ITS 4.875% CUMULATIVE CONVERTIBLE PERPETUAL PREFERENCE SHARES, PAYABLE ON JUNE 1, 2022 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD ON MAY 15, 2022. ABOUT BUNGE AT BUNGE (NYSE: BG), OUR PUR'}